{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a87c5c5f-b0f2-8808-a049-cf9d630eb465",
  "created_at": "2025-12-04T09:58:05-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Linda Lawton",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:52:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:52:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello? Is this Public Works? I'm sorry, I'm hard of hearing, you'll have to speak up a little if I ask you again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:53:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, ma'am, Public Works. This is Denise. What can I do for you this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:53:17-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh good. It's the storm drain in front of my house. It's been grunting and gurgling and slow, and every time we get a thaw it backs right up into the street. Every time! And nothing gets done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:53:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about that. Let me get the address. Where is the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:53:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "252 Bellevue Avenue. Bellevue. Two five two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:53:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two fifty-two Bellevue Avenue, got it. And when you say it backs up, is that when it's warmed up and the snow melts?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:53:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What was that, dear?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:53:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Does it back up when the snow melts? Is that when it happens?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:54:06-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, any thaw. Even a little one. And honestly it's not even raining now. It's dry as a bone out there today, and the water's still sitting. It just doesn't go down. This has been going on a long while and I'm tired of calling about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:54:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So it's slow even in dry weather, not just after a storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:54:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Dry weather! The water just sits at the curb in a big puddle and then it freezes at night. It's a skating rink."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:54:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is the water coming up out of the drain, or is it just not going in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:54:53-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both, I'd say. [line breaks up] it gurgles, you can hear it from the porch, and then the water comes up and spreads across the street toward the driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:55:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up on me a little there. Did you say it spreads toward the driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:55:14-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the driveway. I'm on my cell phone, I'm sorry. And next door there's an older gentleman, he's older than me even, and he can't get out when it's like that. He won't walk through the ice. He's stuck in the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:55:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a real concern, especially with it freezing at night. I'll put that in the notes so the crew knows there's a neighbor who has trouble getting out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:55:46-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Now, will you open a work order? I'd like to know that. And for what date? Because last time somebody said they'd look and nobody came."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:55:59-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll open a work order right now for the drain at two fifty-two Bellevue. As for the date, they'll look at it in the next several days, probably by early next week. I can't tell you the exact day, but it's going on the list today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:56:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Early next week. Did you say next week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:56:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, early next week is the likely window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:56:28-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, all right. I'll be home, I'm not going anywhere. The food truck is parked for the season so I'm here all day, and I can show them the spot if they want."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:56:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's helpful, thank you. Can I get a good number in case somebody needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:56:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0185."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:56:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one eight five. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:56:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. You said it faster than I can, but that's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:57:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. And your name for the work order?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:57:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Linda Lawton. L-A-W-T-O-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:57:11-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Lawton. So I've got the drain in front of two fifty-two Bellevue, slow and backing up on thaws even when it's dry, ice at night, and an elderly neighbor next door who can't get out. Work order's opened."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:57:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's exactly it. Please tell them it's been a long time. I don't want to be calling again in January."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:57:39-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note that it's a repeat complaint. If you don't see anyone by the middle of next week, call back and ask for me, Denise, and I'll check on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:57:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Denise. All right. Thank you, dear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:57:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care, and stay off that ice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:58:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Goodbye now."
    }
  ],
